      "label": "Numbers With Units",
      "excerpt": "Coherence first. What exists: Star Wars's own to measure (amount) in (unit) acti",
      "text": "Create the base `dimensions` class in TS, then the actual unit files in spell.\n\nSomething like `\nlength is a dimension:\n  - its base is \"meters\", aka \"m\"\n  - one \"centimeter\", aka \"cm\", is 1/100 m\n  - one \"inch', aka \"in\", aka '\"', is 2.54cm\n```",
      "by": "owenoak",
      "at": "2026-11-04T01:21:07.076Z",
      "status": "new",
      "quote": "Dimensions",
